          "id": "TfiOj",
          "name": "Entries",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2026-09-05 · Enlace expirado and Contraseña actualizada drawn — the reset journey's two endings, AUTH-2\n2026-09-05 · the brief stopped saying 'design-led, code is reference (D8)'; D78 retired that posture\n2026-09-05 · the brief stopped restating the kit version, which read 0.8.0 against a variable saying 0.8.1 (X4)\n2026-09-05 · this file adopted the Log frame; the brief's three dated lines moved here\n2026-08-27 · ADR-018 supersedes D23 — TOTP with recovery codes is built, and the brief had called it settled while nothing existed\n2026-08-27 · D52 · the product asks for enrollment in BOTH the first-boot wizard and Ajustes\n2026-08-27 · Panel · V1…V4 moved to _playground.pen — moved, not deleted: they are the reasoning",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
